98,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["AC4: 'terminal sidecar_emitted=false without a receipt reports findings.readable=false and reason=\"sidecar-not-emitted\"'","AC10: 'legacy terminal records without a receipt report findings.readable=false, reason=\"review-result-generation-unknown\", with job_started_at diagnostic only'","Disposition lists both 'sidecar-not-emitted without a receipt' and 'review-result-generation-unknown' as unavailable but does not state how the readability computation decides which reason applies"],"finding":"Two distinct 'without a receipt' terminal cases map to two different reason codes (sidecar-not-emitted vs review-result-generation-unknown) but the discriminator between them is not explicitly stated.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f350fedd706e6822d","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Fix plan / Disposition paragraph; AC4 and AC10","norm_id":"n3c354c56e779a346","priority":0.402,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer receives a terminal run-index entry with no sidecar receipt and must choose which reason code to emit"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a sentence: a terminal record that carries the explicit `sidecar_emitted=false`/absent-`sidecar_reviewed_at` fields reports `sidecar-not-emitted`, whereas a legacy record that lacks these index fields entirely reports `review-result-generation-unknown`.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_un